0..71 Comment "// Bounded naturals as they should read, and what refuses each program."
72..74 Comment "//"
75..153 Comment "// `Fin(n)` holds the naturals below `n`. A case on one binds each arm\'s index"
154..233 Comment "// equation. It solves an equation with a variable side and prunes an arm whose"
234..307 Comment "// ends are apart. It prunes no match of no arms. An equation between two"
308..337 Comment "// successors stays unsolved."
338..340 Comment "//"
341..412 Comment "// The checker refuses each declaration below by the name its attribute"
413..491 Comment "// states. Each turns to `checks` as its rung lands, and the source then moves"
492..513 Comment "// to the model root."
514..516 Comment "//"
517..579 Comment "// - owes: #3484 — the empty match at an indexed family, for"
580..596 Comment "//   `absurdFin`"
597..643 Comment "// - owes: #3515 — injectivity, for `lookup`"
644..699 Comment "// - see: #3481 — the spike that wrote these programs"
701..737 Comment "// The naturals the bounds count in."
